# Void (Game.isVoid, Game.java:1432-1435): a nonland permanent left the
# battlefield this turn. Shock kills the Grizzly Bears first, so Plasma Bolt's
# `X:Count$Void.3.2` reads the turn's departures (Game.leftBattlefieldThisTurn,
# GameAction.java:539-540) and deals 3 to the opponent instead of 2.
startturn human
advance 3
tapformana human 3 R
queue targets 5
castspell human 1
resolvestack
tapformana human 4 R
queue targets ai
castspell human 2
resolvestack
